# The rulebook's damage examples, played out: Chrysanthemum steals from an Underbridge Stray, and
# aggravated damage on Nassir and Tamoszius (vekn.net/rulebook, "Steal Blood", "Damage Resolution").
# Each block is a hunt by Chrysanthemum; Bob, her prey, blocks.
# Cards are given by VEKN ID; names and images come from the content pack (LEGAL-08).
seed 5
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A 201542 *12
library A 101993 *40
crypt B 201563 *6 201571 *6
library B 102065 *40
crypt C 201573 *12
library C 101993 *40
start

# Fast-forward: Chrysanthemum (capacity 5) with 4 blood; Nassir with 1, Tamoszius with 2 (sped up
# for the demo).
A> transfer +5 A:uncontrolled:1
A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> transfer -1 A:ready:1
B> transfer +1 B:uncontrolled:1
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> transfer +2 B:uncontrolled:2
B> move B:uncontrolled:2 ready
B> play B:hand:1 ready
B> life +2 B:ready:3
C> transfer +5 C:uncontrolled:1
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion

# "Chrysanthemum enters combat with an Underbridge Stray ally. Chrysanthemum has a capacity of 5 and
# has 4 blood. The ally has 2 life." She steals 2 blood as her strike; the ally strikes for 1.
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:3
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
A> strike steal 2
B> strike hand
A> pass
B> pass
# The 2 life move to Chrysanthemum: 6 blood, 1 drains off over her capacity; the ally, with no life
# left, is burned; she mends the 1 damage, leaving 4 blood.
log public Round 1 · Damage: Chrysanthemum (G6) steals 2 life from Underbridge Stray; 1 drains off, over capacity
log public Round 1 · Damage: Underbridge Stray has no life left and is burned
log public Round 1 · Damage: Chrysanthemum (G6) takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
expect card A:ready:1 blood 4
expect count B:ashHeap 1
A> pass round
B> pass round
A> pass
expect action none

# "Nassir is ready and has 1 blood when he receives 1 point of aggravated damage. He cannot mend
# this damage, so he is wounded and goes to torpor with 1 blood."
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
A> strike 1A
B> strike none
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Nassir (G6) takes 1 aggravated and goes to torpor
expect card B:torpor:1 blood 1
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
expect action none

# "Tamoszius is ready and has 2 blood when he receives 3 points of aggravated damage. He becomes
# wounded by 1 point, and so he must burn 2 blood to prevent destruction from the other 2 points,
# leaving him empty and in torpor."
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
A> strike 3A
B> strike none
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Tamoszius (G6) takes 3 aggravated (2 blood) and goes to torpor
expect card B:torpor:2 blood 0
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
expect action none
